00:31:09,200 --> 00:31:18,500
I'd probably feel a little bit different about it, but whereas, there's such an abundance of open space here, interior,

308
00:31:19,180 --> 00:31:26,540
I don't know why we would want to have protective radii fall on the land above, right?

309
00:31:27,160 --> 00:31:29,420
Now, we don't control that here.

310
00:31:29,800 --> 00:31:31,400
Now, that's not, that's a statement.

